            <ArticleTitle>Prophylaxis of postmyelogram headaches.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>869-71</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>One hundred patients undergoing myelography received prophylactic autologous epidural blood patches to prevent postmyelogram headache. The results indicate a significant reduction in the incidence and severity of this problem compared to a control group, without any significant side effects.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
